# The demo catalogue (DEMO-01, docs/DEMO.md): the Federation's shared SKUs, their trade prices and
# the opening stock. One SKU per line, fields separated by |. Read by lk.coopfed.knoweb.demo.
# Change a line here and run `make reset && make up && make demo-data` to see it; the loader matches
# SKUs by their English name, so renaming one adds a new SKU on a stack that already has the old one.
#
# name_en | name_si | name_ta | base unit | sold by weight | batch tracked | expiry tracked |
# printed MRP | tax category | pack unit | units per pack | Federation price | Federation price
# from 100 | distributor price to societies | Federation unit cost | opening qty at the Federation
# warehouse | opening qty at each distributor | MRP on the pack (Rs) | shelf life (days)
